@startuml SSD_UC11_ViewProductionOverview
title SSD - UC11 View the production overview
hide footbox

actor ":Production Coordinator" as PC
participant ":Production Record System" as S

PC -> S : viewProductionOverview()
S --> PC : overview, one heading per category (FR12):\n- proposals awaiting a decision\n- proposals held for future consideration\n- upcoming recording sessions and missing equipment\n- missing consent\n- outstanding permissions\n- drafts awaiting review\n- blocked drafts, each with what blocks it\n- scheduled publications

opt see one blocked draft in detail
  PC -> S : viewDraftBlockers(draft)
  S --> PC : each outstanding permission, missing consent\nor unresolved review outcome for that draft (BR5)
end

note right of S
  Query only: nothing is created or changed.
  Blocked is derived, never stored (RD-04, DEC-05).
  Held is listed apart from awaiting a decision (A13).
  Scenarios: GS2, GS4
end note
@enduml
